{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60426","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90120","text":"FleetPrompt Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90121","marks":["bold"],"text":"The open marketplace where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click."}]}],"id":"blk-60427","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90122","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-90123","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90124","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-90125","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90126","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-90127","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-90128","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-60429","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-60431","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90129","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-90130","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-90131","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec — making FleetPrompt the first marketplace where you know exactly what an agent does before you install it."}]},{"id":"blk-60432","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90132","text":"Why FleetPrompt?"}]},{"id":"blk-60433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90133","text":"57% of organizations now have AI agents in production (LangChain 2026). Yet there are "},{"id":"spn-90134","marks":["bold"],"text":"zero open agent marketplaces"},{"id":"spn-90135","text":". Teams build agents in isolation, rediscover the same patterns, and have no way to share, reuse, or monetize production-quality work. Closed platforms (Salesforce AgentForce, OpenAI GPT Store) lock agents into proprietary runtimes. Open frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI) have no distribution story at all."}]},{"id":"blk-60434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90136","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-90137","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-90138","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-60435","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) ← THIS  ·  Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-60436","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90139","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-60437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90140","marks":["bold"],"text":"Homepages"}]},{"id":"blk-60438","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90141","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://ampersandboxdesign.com"}],"text":"[&] Ampersand Box"}]}],"id":"blk-60439","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90142","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://graphonomous.com"}],"text":"Graphonomous"}]}],"id":"blk-60441","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90143","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://bendscript.com"}],"text":"BendScript"}]}],"id":"blk-60443","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90144","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://webhost.systems"}],"text":"WebHost.Systems"}]}],"id":"blk-60445","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90145","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://agentelic.com"}],"text":"Agentelic"}]}],"id":"blk-60447","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90146","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://agentromatic.com"}],"text":"AgenTroMatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60449","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90147","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://delegatic.com"}],"text":"Delegatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90148","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://deliberatic.com"}],"text":"Deliberatic"}]}],"id":"blk-60453","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90149","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://fleetprompt.com"}],"text":"FleetPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-60455","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90150","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://geofleetic.com"}],"text":"GeoFleetic"}]}],"id":"blk-60457","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60460","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90151","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://opensentience.org"}],"text":"OpenSentience"}]}],"id":"blk-60459","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90152","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://specprompt.com"}],"text":"SpecPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-60461","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90153","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://ticktickclock.com"}],"text":"TickTickClock"}]}],"id":